> > > Error: Failed to create the shared library
> > >
> > >

It looks like something in my user nimble function isnt working, but I cant quite make sense of the error. I've attached 2 scripts: one that returns the original dynamic indexing error , and a second script that uses the custom function and returns the compiling issue.

Where is my issue? Any help would be much appreciated. Thanks!

Cat

