Cat,

Have you tried the stochastic indexing version of the code recently?  The old nimble-users exchange you referred to was from December, 2015.  Release notes show that in July 2017 (0.6-6) we supported dynamic (aka stochastic) indexing and in December 2018 (0.6-8) we turned on that support as the default.  Old release notes can be found as blog posts on R-nimble.org.

Best wishes,
Perry

