Hi Cat,

Please define 'grid' in 'inits' or 'data', not in 'constants'.  I
believe that will solve the problem.

Basically, 'constants' get baked into the model and can't be indexed
by a non-constant index value because there is not a variable
representing the constants.

Chris

On Tue, Dec 4, 2018 at 9:16 AM Perry de Valpine <pdeva...@berkeley.edu> wrote:
